{
 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.16.1",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Chat can now do things in Wefty for you: send a picture of a subscription and say \"add this to subscriptions\", or ask it to make a note, add flash cards or set a due date. Each change shows under the answer with Open and Undo.",
  "Repeating reminders: \"Badminton every Tuesday 6pm\", every day, every weekday, every other Friday, every month. Ticking it done (or the time passing) sets the next one, and Chat can set them too.",
  "Flash cards are on Today now, with how many are due, and in Notes' \u22ef menu on a phone.",
  "Today holds still on phones: no more jumping sideways or a white square in the corner.",
  "No more ** or == marks in note titles and previews, and bold words look bold while you type on a phone.",
  "Chat calls itself Wefty now, even in chats you started before the new name.",
  "Wefty now opens on Today: what's due and late, tests coming up, flash cards to review, subscriptions renewing soon, and the notes you were just in. Tick things off right there.",
  "Four tabs: Today, Notes, Share and Chat. Share holds Send, Files and Clipboard together."
 ],
 "build": "1.16.1-755877fa649b",
